WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:01,210
Commander Zhao

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:04,000
You'd better consider these people from the Tamu tribe first.

3
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:06,560
Why attack the Yellow Sand Formation camp?

4
00:00:08,390 --> 00:00:10,710
Attack the Huangsha Formation Camp

5
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:14,040
Weren't you the ones who attacked?

6
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:16,060
Two innate

7
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:17,440
Dozens of acquired incompetents

8
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:18,880
Hundreds of ordinary soldiers

9
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:21,960
Do you think this kind of lineup will appear near the Yellow Sand Formation camp?

10
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:24,260
Just to attack one of our patrol teams

11
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,780
Are they here to take revenge on us?

12
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:28,280
After all, we were more than half a month ago

13
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:30,980
I just killed one of their cavalry squads.

14
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:33,940
What is the buffer area between Ohmae and Kitamyo used for?

15
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,940
Stabilize the relationship between Ohmae and Hokusai

16
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:37,140
Prevent the expansion of conflicts

17
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:39,660
Then if one day the North Blind crosses the buffer zone

18
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:41,940
Launch a direct attack on the Ozen military camp

19
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:46,560
What kind of behavior is this? Li Dao

20
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:48,720
Are you saying that Northern Blind is going to start a war with Ohmae?

21
00:00:50,290 --> 00:00:52,410
It doesn't necessarily mean that Northern Blind wants to start a war with Omae.

22
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:55,400
more likely

23
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:57,200
It means that others are restless if they pass the test
